---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: categories
  size: 1
  alias: selected
permalink: "/categories/{{ selected.id }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ selected.name }}"
---
{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
<header class="page-header"><div class="eyebrow">{{ selected.english }}</div><h1>{{ selected.name }}</h1><p>{{ selected.description }}</p></header>
{% set posts = collections.posts | inCategory(selected.id) %}
<div class="section-heading"><h2>모든 기록 <span class="section-number">{{ posts | length }}</span></h2><span class="section-aside">최신순 ↓</span></div>
{% if posts | length %}{% include "post-list.njk" %}{% else %}<div class="empty-state"><span class="topic-icon {{ selected.color }}">{{ icon(selected.icon) }}</span><h2>다음 기록을 위한 빈 페이지</h2><p>{{ selected.description }}<br>새로운 이야기가 생기면 이곳에 남기겠습니다.</p><a class="intro-link" href="/">다른 기록 둘러보기 {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></div>{% endif %}
